      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elsmere%2C_Delaware"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Elsmere sits at 39°44′21″N 75°35′53″W, just 1.5 miles west of Wilmington’s city center.",
